<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see sunny, warm weather.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see sunny, warm weather.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairie on Monday were forecast to see mainly sunny skies and warm temperatures, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see sun and highs of 18 to 22 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see sun, highs of 18 to 22 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see sun in the west, thundershowers in the east and highs of 24 to 28 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
